       <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&amp;gt;Target exceeded. The e-voucher program was implemented in 20 municipalities in Dosso, Maradi, Tahoua, Tillab&amp;eacute;ry, and Zinder regions. The e-voucher kit consisted only of seeds (10 kg of cereals and 5 kg of cowpea) to cover at least 1.5 ha of crop.&amp;nbsp;in 2018, a&amp;nbsp;total of 30,838 households benefited directly from the program, of whom 26% were headed by women, surpassing the target of 20 000. However the e-voucher program was suspended in 2019 because of lack of funding.&lt;/p&amp;gt;</narrative>
